  "title": "Search orderable tests and panels"
 },
 "description": "Searches currently orderable Vitals Vault tests and panels with customer-safe prices and stable pagination. Results come from a versioned public search document with match provenance and are revalidated against website checkout eligibility. Identity, account data, private results, and PHI are outside the input contract.",
